WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.416
- You called for backups?

00:00:01.416 --> 00:00:02.458
 - Teddy? Name's Hill.

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:04.500
I don't throw the football or line up under center.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.083
I'm not old-fashioned like you.

00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:07.750
- You are three years older than me.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.125
 - Coach says we have to play nice with him.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.958
- ALL I WANTED TO BE WAS STARTER FOR LIFE!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.666
- I want the both of you on this.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.458
 Everyone’s going to be so confused.

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:19.916
- Someone is taking out starters

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:21.666
based on the seven QB sins.

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:22.458
Greed.

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:23.000
Sloth.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.125
- Oh, this is so comfy…

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:24.958
- Gluttony.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.125
- I’m so hungry…

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.000
FOR KNOWLEDGE!

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:27.708
- Pride.

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:29.750
- I-I’ll be back when the Jags are in the playoffs!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:30.375
- Lust.

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.916
- It was my first kiss…

00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:32.708
- And envy.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:34.375
- I JUST WANT THE REFS TO TREAT ME THE SAME.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:35.416
- Now that’s only six.

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:36.041
- A REF.

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:36.666
KILL HIM!

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:37.500
- Uh-uh-uh!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.000
There’s one more quarterback.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.000
- Oh, you nutjob.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.583
We lost good men and Big Ben.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.458
- Don’t you see?

00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:43.083
 No quarterback

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:44.958
 is greater than the almighty shield...

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:45.958
- What’s this?

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:46.583
Ahh! 

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:47.791
The NFL has the upper hand.

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:50.958
- What’s in the box score?!

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:51.958
- It’s a six-game injury. 

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:53.458
You guys only need to win like three games.

00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:55.666
- NOOO!! THAT’S FOREVER!

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:56.708
- DON’T COMMIT PENALTIES.

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:57.708
THAT’S WHAT HE WANTS.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.875
- [Ref blows whistle] HOLDING. ON THE OFFENSE.

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:04.208
- Vince Lombardi once said,

00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:06.791
 “Winners never quit, and quitters never win.”

00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:08.958
I agree with the second part.

00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:14.208
